    "description": "Complete API collection for Shopzo E-Commerce Platform. Backend deployed on Render: https://shopzo-xuo9.onrender.com\n\n## Setup\n1. Register a user via POST /auth/register\n2. Login via POST /auth/login — copy the token from the response\n3. In the collection Variables, paste the token into `authToken`\n4. All protected routes will automatically use it via the Authorization header\n\n## Load Testing\nUse the Collection Runner or Postman Performance tab to run load tests.",
